---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AboutPlainLead from '../../components/AboutPlainLead.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"Metabolic Intelligence: Budget-Native Compute from Tag to Campus"}
  description={"About: Metabolic Intelligence: Budget-Native Compute from Tag to Campus. Metabolic Intelligence (MEI) is a class of computer intelligence designed to run inside a fixed energy budget."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Product white paper · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Metabolic Intelligence: Budget-Native Compute from Tag to Campus
    </h1>
    <AboutPlainLead id="mei" />
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      Metabolic Intelligence (MEI) is a class of computer intelligence designed to run inside a fixed energy budget. This paper defines the class, reports emulator, datasheet, and open reference-hardware CAD results on a cold-chain sensor tag, and reports a protocol-level test of a grid-following data center, each labeled by evidence class.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">In plain words</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>Give a computer a fixed energy budget, and design it to give the best answer it can inside that budget.</li>
        <li>A tiny sensor tag that checks food freshness can then run for about eight years on a coin battery at room temperature, and under cold-chain voltage sag a signed budget gate refuses routine radio beacons so safety-critical alerts still get through.</li>
        <li>A data center can cut its power use when the electricity grid asks, by pausing or shrinking work, without giving wrong answers.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">Reference hardware &amp; JCP receipt package · MEI-JCP-Tag-v1</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li><strong>2-layer PCB (<code>32.0 mm × 24.0 mm</code>):</strong> 10 components (<code>STM32WBA52</code> MCU, <code>TI INA238</code> + <code>100 mΩ</code> shunt, <code>256-Kb</code> SPI <code>FRAM</code> <code>JCR-1</code> ring, <code>10 kΩ</code> NTC divider, <code>CR2032</code> holder), 14 nets autorouted 100% (135 segments, 14 vias), <strong>0 DRC violations</strong>, exported to RS-274X Gerbers, Excellon drill, <code>.kicad_pcb</code>, BOM, and CPL CSVs.</li>
        <li><strong>3D B-Rep enclosure (<code>36.0 mm × 28.0 mm × 7.5 mm</code> + lanyard ear):</strong> snap-fit vented shell (`2,702.12 mm³`, `2.837 g` ABS) exported to ISO-10303 <code>STEP</code> and binary <code>STL</code> (852 triangles).</li>
        <li><strong>Cold-chain budget gate (<code>cad-sim::battery</code> + <code>jcp-runtime</code>):</strong> across <code>10,000</code> wakeups at <code>-20 °C</code>, <code>+4 °C</code>, and <code>+25 °C</code>, two-phase <code>hold</code> / <code>settle</code> sharding refuses 490 of 500 non-essential beacons under <code>-20 °C</code> cell impedance sag while preserving <strong>40 / 40 (100%)</strong> safety-critical excursion alerts, verified via Ed25519 <code>COSE_Sign1</code> <code>JCR-1</code> replay.</li>
        <li><strong>Evidence status:</strong> fabrication and simulation package (<code>board_metered: false</code>, <code>measured_j: null</code>; build-host Linux RAPL recorded separately in <code>reported_j</code>).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/products/mei/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /products/mei/
      </a>
      <a href="/living/mei/#mei-jcp-explorer" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan border border-brand-cyan/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-cyan/10 transition-colors">
        Interactive PCB &amp; Cold-Chain Explorer →
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/mei.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
